# Shared build context exclusions for apps/api, apps/worker, and apps/web Dockerfiles
# (all three build from the repository root).

# Host node_modules must never reach the image. apps/web/Dockerfile installs
# dependencies inside node:26-alpine (musl), and the later `COPY apps/web ./`
# would otherwise overwrite them with the host's glibc tree, breaking native
# bindings such as @rolldown/binding-linux-x64-*.
**/node_modules

.git
.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
apps/web/dist
